# Gate build output + local restore artifacts (RS-254/UX-006). The spec also
# wants a repo-root .gitignore rule for gate.trx/TestResults; that repo-root file
# is added at GREEN (Stage-A scope forbids repo-root edits here).
bin/
obj/
TestResults/
# Generated TRX output. The real gate.trx lands in TestResults/ (ignored above);
# this is a defensive catch for any stray TRX written elsewhere.
*.trx
# ...but the committed TRX FIXTURES for the INV-014 trx-guard self-tests are DATA,
# not generated output. They MUST be tracked: a fresh CI clone needs them, else
# trx-guard.sh cannot find happy.trx and the happy-path INV-014 tests fail (a
# fresh-clone-only failure a local `rm -rf out` run cannot surface).
!Corrected.Gate.Tests/fixtures/trx/*.trx
